00:13:38.381 --> 00:13:40.349
Bersiaplah untuk menerima transportasi darurat.

234
00:13:40.383 --> 00:13:41.407
Berdiri di sana, Kapten

235
00:13:41.451 --> 00:13:42.418
Komandan yang

236
